W:Chorus:
W:Fido, the rabid dog, he bit my sister Sally-o
W:Fido, the rabid dog, he bit my sister Sally-o
W:
W:1. Fido was a Pekinese, a rare breed, a rabid breed
W:And he brought home trash and ticks and fleas
W:And bit my sister Sally-o.
W:
W:Chorus:
W:
W:2. And in that trash there was a bird, a dead bird, a rotten bird
W:Bird in the trash with the ticks and the fleas
W:Brought home by the rabid Pekinese
W:That bit my sister Sally-o.
W:
W:Chorus:
W:
W:3. And on that bird there was a tick, a small tick, a deadly tick
W:And it gave poor Sally lyme disease,
W:Along with the rabies, ticks and fleas
W:Brought home by the rabid Pekinese
W:That bit my sister Sally-o.
